cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the saved scores, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "fractal-texture-defect-detection"
abstract: >-
  Training-free detection of defects in textures by invariant block matching against a few defect-free
  reference images. The detector is derived from the encoder of a fractal (PIFS) image codec. The repository
  contains the code, the evaluation protocol and the per-tile scores of the experiments on AITEX and MVTec AD.
authors:
